atic melanoma cells called cannibalism and is involved in the pH regulation of the intracellular vesicles in tumor cells (PubMed:19893578)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_03","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}